OL,3,CTV-related anniversaries for 04 OCT
OL,4,CCHANNELS
OL,5,
OL,6,CG1997FBBC One launches its
OL,7,Fballoon-based channel identity.
OL,8,
OL,9,FThe change coincides with the
OL,10,Fintroduction of a new BBC logo.
OL,11,
OL,12,CG1997FThe BBC One on-screen
OL,13,Fpresentation package first seen on 16th
OL,14,FFebruary 1991 bows out just before 3am.
OL,15,
OL,16,CG1997FBBC Two closes down for the
OL,17,Fnight just before 2.30am, using the
OL,18,F1991 - 1997 on-screen presentation
OL,19,Fpackage for the final time.
