OL,3,CTV-related anniversaries for 04 OCT
OL,4,CCHANNELS
OL,5,
OL,6,CG1997FBBC Two comes on air at 7.20am
OL,7,Fwith an updated on-screen identity.
OL,8,
OL,9,FMany of the channel's idents from the
OL,10,F1991 - 1997 period survived the change,
OL,11,Falbeit now slightly zoomed and
OL,12,Fincorporating the new BBC logo.
OL,13,
OL,14,FThree new idents are now available for
OL,15,Fuse: Ariel, Paint-Pot and Zapper.
